title: "DW-AI-ARCH: A Seven-Layer, Ten-Gate Framework for Enterprise AI Architecture"
abstract: >-
  The formal edition (v1.0) of the DeepWing Framework: 385 numbered clauses
  and 70 check items for enterprise AI systems, organised in seven layers
  and ten gates, with every judgment carrying an evidence grade. Published
  by DeepWing, an independent AI intelligence and research platform. The
  canonical home of the framework is deepwingai.com; this repository is the
  public mirror for citation and reuse.
